        "id": "610:34",
        "text": "Corporate Video"
      },
      "body": {
        "id": "610:33",
        "text": "I worked with Obayashi North America’s HR team to create a video giving prospective candidates an inside look at the company’s culture and employee experience. My role included conducting employee interviews, filming, and editing the final video.",
        "width": 546
      },
